  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto National Teacher Day Education Promises",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto pledged education reforms, teacher training abroad, and infrastructure upgrades during National Teacher Day 2026 celebrations.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto pledged to upgrade 200,000 schools and increase teacher salaries during the 2026 National Teacher Day ceremony.",
    "A new teacher training program will send 3,350 educators to Canada and Russia for international development starting in 2027.",
    "The government launched the Studio Guru initiative to promote digital learning and improve educational access across thousands of schools."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto announced a series of policy initiatives during the 2026 National Teacher Day commemoration held at the Sentul International Convention Center in Bogor. Key pledges include a commitment to infrastructure improvements for 200,000 schools and salary increases for educators. The government also unveiled the Studio Guru program to support digital transformation in learning. Additionally, plans were revealed to dispatch 3,350 teachers to Canada and Russia for specialized training beginning in 2027. Minister of Basic and Secondary Education Abdul Mu'ti requested further support for teacher welfare, while reports indicated the administration has already allocated approximately 90 trillion rupiah in allowances. During the event, the president recognized the contributions of disabled educators and emphasized the broader goal of improving national educational quality and teacher prosperity across the country.",
